window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The Hunter rides for vengeance . . . and embarks on a voyage of bloodshed and death.</b></p> <p>His pursuit of the escaped Groebus Dayblood and his assassin accomplices leads to the shores of Einan and beyond, across the Frozen Sea.</p> <p>But danger follows wherever the Hunter goes. Sailing with him are parties unknown plotting bloody murder. Their deadly blades are aimed at him, and trapped aboard a ship in the middle of the ocean, there is nowhere to run or hide.</p> <p><b><i>Pirates, cutthroats, and dark arcane magic capable of mind-shattering horrors, the Hunter must fight them all to protect the one person who matters most: his daughter.</i></b></p>"; 
